                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Connect your own workspace",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#EB6834",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Home > Transform data > Edit parameters: set DataSource = Databricks, then ServerHostname, HttpPath, Catalog, Schema (where you created vw_billing_usage_with_attribution) and LocalCurrency. Sign in with a token or Microsoft Entra ID and Refresh. DataSource = Demo loads sample data from GitHub.",
